Data
----
This repository contains no molecular dynamics trajectories, no extracted latents and no trained model weights. The pipeline is
designed for the ATLAS database of protein molecular dynamics simulations. `scripts/fetch_atlas_trajectories.py` and
`scripts/fetch_atlas_sequences.py` download from the ATLAS servers; nothing from ATLAS is redistributed here.

  Vander Meersche Y, Cretin G, Gheeraert A, Gelly J-C, Galochkina T. ATLAS: protein flexibility description from atomistic molecular
  dynamics simulations. Nucleic Acids Research 52(D1):D384-D392 (2024). doi:10.1093/nar/gkad1084  https://www.dsimb.inserm.fr/ATLAS

The data are governed by ATLAS's own terms of use, which are stated on the ATLAS website and not by the licence on this code. Anyone who
runs this pipeline on ATLAS, and anyone who redistributes latents extracted from ATLAS trajectories, should read those terms first and
comply with them, including the citation above.

The result summaries the analysis scripts write are numerical summaries computed from ATLAS-derived latents; they contain no
coordinates and no latents.
